@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam stateBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
title OffDelay（问题 6）：enabled 在 Active 和 Holding 中为 true

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Active : request && !stop
Active --> Holding : !request
Active --> Idle : stop
Holding --> Active : request
Holding --> Idle : stop || age >= delay
note "即使输入未知，Holding 也会到期。\n健康的停止或无效的延时：任意阶段 -> Idle。" as N
@enduml
